       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose is well above the maximum for ibuprofen.\n\n- **Ordered:** 1600 mg four times daily, which is 6,400 mg/day.\n- **Usual maximum:** 800 mg per dose and 3,200 mg/day for adults in a monitored setting. The OTC limit is 1,200 mg/day.\n- **Risks at this dose:** GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events. These risks rise sharply above the labeled maximum, even with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg by mouth, four times daily** (3,200 mg/day, the maximum)\n- **1600 mg per day in divided doses**, such as 400 mg four times daily\n- **400\u2013800 mg by mouth every 6\u20138 hours as needed**\n\nIf you do want 1600 mg four times daily, tell me and include a clinical rationale for the order note. I can then enter it as written."
